## 思路

**二分**:找最大行数 `x`,使前 `x` 行硬币总数 `x*(x+1)/2 <= n`。

## 参考代码

```js
function arrangeCoins(n) {
  let left = 0;
  let right = n;
  while (left <= right) {
    const mid = (left + right) >>> 1;
    const need = (mid * (mid + 1)) / 2;
    if (need === n) return mid;
    if (need < n) left = mid + 1;
    else right = mid - 1;
  }
  return right;
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(log n)
- 空间:O(1)
